  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level the phantom thief gains Greater Steal as a bonus feat even if he does not meet the prerequisites. In addition the phantom thief may attempt to steal Items that are closely worn (such as armor, backpacks, boots, clothing, or rings). Creatures receive a +8 bonus to their CMD to resist the theft of items that are closely worn but do not cover their entire body (such as rings or gloves), and a +15 bonus against that are closely worn and cover their entire body (such as armor and clothing).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/phantom-thief#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
